<title>FINLAND: VALTAMERI SAYS SELLS DIGISTAR STAKE.</title>
<headline>VALTAMERI SAYS SELLS DIGISTAR STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish trading house Valtameri Oy said in a statement on Friday it had sold its 35 percent holding in photo product maker Oy Digistar Ab for an undisclosed sum to state-owned printing house Oy Edita Ab.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal will not have any significant impact on Valtameri's earnings for the current financial year,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
